      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available now. **When applying for this property, please provide as much information as possible about all applicants. The more information we have the better as we receive a large amount of applications daily**\n\nGet Let is delighted to offer this 3 bed spacious duplex apartment to the lettings market. Located in Adamstown, a short walk to the train station that will bring you to Heuston Station. There are bus stops very close to the property, both bring you to City Centre. Great schools nearby; Giraffe creche, Educate Together, St John the Evangelist & Adamstown Community College. Londis and other convenience stores a short walk away. Supervalu, Liffey Valley and other shops a short drive away. Close to the N4 and 16km to the city centre.\n\nDownstairs comprises of hallway, fully fitted kitchen, living room and WC. There is a private rear patio area, behind which there is a designated car park space.\n\nUpstairs comprises of landing, master bedroom with ensuite, and two spacious double bedrooms, all with ample wardrobe space.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nTo register your interest please email Michelle Hoare of Get Let by clicking on `Email Advertiser` to the right of this advertisement. Please submit a brief application with details of how many people it is for and when you wish to move home. Private viewings shall then take place by appointment only.\n\nGet Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324.\n\n"
